- The seeds `search-rescore-a` and `-b` are chosen so the two offers differ; the `!offered.contains(&answer)` assert guards that.

Commands:
- `cargo test -p jackioh-ai --test ai rescored_own_prompts_1636`
- `cargo test -p jackioh-ai --lib --test ai --test ai_slow` (planner: 9 + 520 + 79 pass, 4 ignored as daily)
- `cargo clippy -p jackioh-ai --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo fmt --check`
- `cargo jackioh gate` (planner: passes; ai-vs-random 20/20, ai-vs-greedy 15/20, hard-vs-easy 18/20, 0 panics)
